{
  "bodyHash": "w8Vtjry9dBw=",
  "content": "你好世界CQR 是針對《Minecraft》1.12.2 版本重新設計的 Chocolate Quest（您可能更熟悉它的別名「更好的地牢」），未來也可能持續更新。\n如果 Curseforge 目前無法使用，您可以點擊此處從我們的網站下載最新版本。\n\n**此模組需要 GECKOLIB 和 REACHFIX，若未安裝將無法啟動。* 您可以在以下連結取得它們：https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib, https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reach-fix\n\n<div class=\"page-content\"><article><span>Chocolate Quest Repoured 是 Chocolatin 製作的著名 BetterDungeons / ChocolateQuest 模組的重新復甦！</span><br><br><span>為了實現這個目標，我們必須從頭開始，這意味著這是一個完全不同的模組，但仍深受其啟發。</span><br><span>我們希望透過這個熱情專案，為您帶來絕佳的體驗，這是由幾位投入閒暇時間的個人所實現的。</span><br><br><span>以下我們概述了主模組中您可以探索的各類地牢，但這並未涵蓋全部內容。</span></article><hr class=\"line-solid\"><div class=\"section-item\"><header>雄偉堡壘</header><div class=\"slideshow-with-description\"><div class=\"slideshow-container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-container\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-wrapper slide \"><div class=\"images-wrap\" style=\"transform: translate(-6104px); width: 9156px;\"><div data-index=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"0\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/1.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"1\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/2.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"2\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/3.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"3\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"4\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/5.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"5\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/6.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"6\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/7.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"7\" class=\"active\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"false\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles/8.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"8\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"9\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"10\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><article class=\"slideshow-with-description-right\"><section>很久以前，各個種族建造了巨大的城堡式聚落，以居住並抵禦主世界帶來的危險。</section><br><section>這些堅固的堡壘散佈在草原上，內部藏有豐厚的獎勵。</section></article></div></div></div><br><div class=\"section-item\"><header>火山</header><div class=\"slideshow-with-description order-reverse\"><div class=\"slideshow-container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-container\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-wrapper slide \"><div class=\"images-wrap\" style=\"transform: translate(-1526px); width: 4578px;\"><div data-index=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"0\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/volcano/1.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"1\" class=\"active\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"false\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/volcano/2.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"2\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/volcano/3.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"3\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/volcano/4.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"4\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><article class=\"slideshow-with-description-left\"><section>作為充滿資源與財富的巨大地質結構，火山曾是矮人夢寐以求的最佳家園。然而，很久以前，矮人帝國被稱為哥布林的生物所侵占。</section><br><section>征服火山，入侵其中的堡壘，開採所有礦石吧！</section></article></div></div><br><div class=\"section-item\"><header>冰霜與雪原</header><div class=\"slideshow-with-description\"><div class=\"slideshow-container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-container\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-wrapper slide \"><div class=\"images-wrap\" style=\"transform: translate(-763px); width: 8393px;\"><div data-index=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"0\" class=\"active\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"false\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles_snow/1.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"1\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"2\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles_snow/3.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"3\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"4\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"5\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles_snow/6.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"6\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles_snow/7.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"7\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/castles_snow/8.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"8\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"9\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><article class=\"slideshow-with-description-right\"><section>被驅逐出家園維度，並遭其他種族與部落鄙視，行者們無處可去，只能棲身於他們現在稱為領土的冰冷、荒涼的平原。</section><br><section>他們居住在遠古時期建造的巨大堡壘中。</section></article></div></div><br><div class=\"section-item\"><header>地下要塞</header><div class=\"slideshow-with-description order-reverse\"><div class=\"slideshow-container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-container\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-wrapper slide \"><div class=\"images-wrap\" style=\"transform: translate(-763px); width: 8393px;\"><div data-index=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"0\" class=\"active\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"false\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"1\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"2\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/strongholds/3.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"3\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"4\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"5\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/strongholds/6.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"6\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"7\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"8\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"9\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><article class=\"slideshow-with-description-left\"><section>由不同種族群體建造，炎熱的沙漠與冰冷的平原因罕見的大型地下要塞而文明化。</section><br><section>從入口的大小來看，它們似乎很小。但請小心！地下隱藏著充滿寶藏與敵人的龐大複合式房間！</section></article></div></div><br><div class=\"section-item\"><header>前哨站</header><div class=\"slideshow-with-description\"><div class=\"slideshow-container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-container\"><div class=\"react-slideshow-wrapper slide \"><div class=\"images-wrap\" style=\"transform: translate(-3815px); width: 6867px;\"><div data-index=\"-1\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"0\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/outposts/1.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"1\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"2\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://dertoaster98.github.io/cq-repoured-website/slides/outposts/3.jpg\"></div></div><div data-index=\"3\" class=\"\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 763px; display: block;\"><div class=\"each-slide\"><span class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></span></div></div><div data-index=\"4\" class=\"active\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-hidden